WEBVTT

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:07.250
Sijil keeps your important documents and renewal dates in one
clear workspace, so you can see what needs attention.

00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:16.130
Start by adding a license, contract, or permit. Save the document
and its key dates, so every deadline has a record.

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:25.330
Reminders help you act before expiry. Open Notifications to review
upcoming deadlines and see which documents are ready for renewal.

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:33.330
The dashboard brings overdue and upcoming items together, with an
expiry timeline that makes the next priorities easy to spot.

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:40.810
When it is time to act, search the documents list, check the
status, and choose Renew to keep the record up to date.
